{"id":"keeper","name":{"zh":"灯台官舍","en":"KEEPER'S HOUSE"},"w":14,"h":10,"floor":"floor.png","solid":["11111111111111","11111111111111","11111111111111","11110111000011","10000110000101","10000000000001","11100000011001","10000000111111","11100100100001","11111100111111"],"things":[{"key":"counter","image":"things/counter.png","x":32,"y":128,"w":64,"h":56,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"stove","image":"things/stove.png","x":96,"y":128,"w":32,"h":62,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"desk","image":"things/desk.png","x":160,"y":128,"w":64,"h":48,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"chair","image":"things/chair.png","x":176,"y":154,"w":32,"h":48,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"radio","image":"things/radio.png","x":224,"y":128,"w":32,"h":54,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"futon","image":"things/futon.png","x":386,"y":128,"w":30,"h":26,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"tea","image":"things/tea.png","x":354,"y":160,"w":32,"h":36,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"lens","image":"things/lens.png","x":34,"y":224,"w":60,"h":84,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"chest","image":"things/chest.png","x":34,"y":288,"w":60,"h":40,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"cups","image":"things/cups.png","x":288,"y":256,"w":64,"h":52,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"chair-guest","image":"things/chair-guest.png","x":256,"y":248,"w":32,"h":42,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"chair-own","image":"things/chair-own.png","x":352,"y":248,"w":32,"h":42,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"coat","image":"things/coat.png","x":164,"y":288,"w":24,"h":46,"frames":1,"fps":0},{"key":"heater","image":"things/heater.png","x":384,"y":256,"w":32,"h":48,"frames":1,"fps":0}],"spawn":{"x":224,"y":278,"dir":"up"},"exit":[[6,9],[7,9]],"interact":[{"id":"chart","label":"看看海图和潮汐表","cells":[[8,2],[9,2]],"anchor":[292,18],"first":"海图上，一条铅笔线从鸥岛往东拉出去，出了图边，没写到哪儿。旁边的潮汐表，每个星期四都用铅笔描黑了。"},{"id":"logbook","label":"翻翻海面日志","cells":[[5,3],[6,3]],"anchor":[192,82],"first":"日志摊在昨天那页：风，西南，三级。浪，一米。能见度，好。最后一行写着「无船」，铅笔描了两遍。"},{"id":"radio","label":"拧开收音机","cells":[[7,3]],"anchor":[240,70],"first":"旋钮有点涩。先是沙沙声，然后一个女声念：「……鸥岛近海，西南风三到四级，浪高一米。」念完又是沙沙声。"},{"id":"lens","label":"看看玻璃柜","cells":[[1,6],[2,6]],"anchor":[64,136],"first":"玻璃后面是一片片弯弯的厚玻璃，一圈一圈的棱，对着光会把窗子分成好几个。每片底下压着一张小纸条，写着日期。"},{"id":"cups","label":"看看桌上的杯子","cells":[[9,6],[10,6],[9,7],[10,7]],"anchor":[320,200],"first":"两只杯子。搪瓷的那只有一圈茶渍，还是温的。白瓷的那只倒扣在碟子上，擦得很干净，碟子边上落着一片干掉的盐花。"}],"seats":[{"id":"desk","x":192,"y":148,"dir":"up"},{"id":"guest","x":272,"y":250,"dir":"right"},{"id":"own","x":368,"y":250,"dir":"left"}],"npcs":[{"id":"lighthouse","x":288,"y":122,"dir":"up"}],"windows":[{"x":171,"y":32,"w":42,"h":26}],"lights":[{"x":154,"y":86,"r":120,"color":"#ffd28c"},{"x":80,"y":104,"r":100,"color":"#ffe2a8"},{"x":240,"y":104,"r":40,"color":"#ffcf7a"},{"x":400,"y":232,"r":110,"color":"#ffb070"}],"floorType":"wood","music":"keeper"}